  "label": "MRtrix3 tckmap",
  "description": "Use track data as a form of contrast for producing a high-resolution image\nNote: if you run into limitations with RAM usage, make sure you output the results to a .mif file or .mih / .dat file pair - this will avoid the allocation of an additional buffer to store the output for write-out.",
